stdout:
Usage: ryi ingest [OPTIONS] <PATH>...
Validate and re-emit foreign TSI JSONL

Examples:
  ryi ingest crates/sprefa-extract/tests/fixtures/ingest/00_foreign.jsonl
  ryi ingest crates/sprefa-extract/tests/fixtures/ingest/05_symbol.jsonl

Flags:
  --sqlite <PATH>  Write to a new SQLite database instead of stdout
