=== diff (exit 0) ===
stdout:
Usage: ryi diff [OPTIONS] --from <REV> --to <REV>
Fact delta between two commits

Examples:
  ryi diff --from HEAD --to HEAD --root . --pattern '*.ts'
  ryi diff --from HEAD --to HEAD --root . --pattern '*.rs'

Common: --root <DIR>

Flags:
  --from <REV>  reachability from [PATH#]NAME
  --to <REV>  Target revision
  --pattern <GLOB>  Glob to include
  --arms <ARMS>  Resolve arms (call,type)
  --sqlite <PATH>  Write to a new SQLite database instead of stdout
