=== watch (exit 0) ===
stdout:
Usage: ryi watch [OPTIONS]
Stream fact deltas as the worktree changes

Examples:
  ryi watch --root crates/sprefa-extract/tests/fixtures/cleave_ts/basic --once
  ryi watch --root crates/sprefa-extract/tests/fixtures/cleave_ts/basic --once --pattern '*.ts'

Common: --root <DIR>

Flags:
  --pattern <GLOB>  Glob to watch
  --kinds <KINDS>  Fact kinds (cst,type,call,df,data)
  --receipts <PATH>  Receipt store path
  --poll-ms <POLL_MS>  Poll interval when the platform watcher is unavailable
Switches:
  --once  Emit one snapshot and exit
