=== cleave (exit 0) ===
stdout:
Usage: ryi cleave [OPTIONS] [TARGET] [DEST]
Move one item into another file, with its imports

Examples:
  ryi cleave crates/sprefa-extract/tests/fixtures/cleave_ts/basic/src/util.ts#slug crates/sprefa-extract/tests/fixtures/cleave_ts/basic/src/slug.ts --root crates/sprefa-extract/tests/fixtures/cleave_ts/basic
  ryi cleave crates/sprefa-extract/tests/fixtures/cleave_ts/basic/src/util.ts#slug crates/sprefa-extract/tests/fixtures/cleave_ts/basic/src/slug.ts --root crates/sprefa-extract/tests/fixtures/cleave_ts/basic --text-refs

Common: --root <ROOT>

Flags:
  --list <LIST>  TSV of SRC#ITEM<TAB>DEST rows, applied in order as one stage
  --state <STATE>  Soopy state root, outside the corpus
  --verify <VERIFY>  Command to run after --commit
Switches:
  --drag  Also move private helpers only this item uses | --slow  Use rust-analyzer for Rust and the TypeScript LSP for TS
  --commit  Apply instead of dry run | --text-refs  Report leftover SRC spellings in plain text
  --json  End with one JSON line holding the plan
